	//   - Zero B
	//   - For each t, add A[*,t] * A[*,t]^T to B
	//
	// Here we compute B element-wise:
	//   for each (r,s) we accumulate over t into a scalar and store B[r][s].
	// This keeps B[r][s] in a register for the whole dot-product and improves
	// cache locality for A[r,*] and A[s,*]. The mathematical result is the
	// same (only the summation order changes).
	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
